  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mo>]</mo><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>V</mi><msup><mo>]</mo><mi>a</mi></msup><mo>[</mo><mi>T</mi><msup><mo>]</mo><mi>b</mi></msup><mo>[</mo><mi>F</mi><msup><mo>]</mo><mi>c</mi></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mo>]</mo><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>a</mi></msup><mo>[</mo><mi>T</mi><msup><mo>]</mo><mi>b</mi></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>c</mi></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mo>]</mo><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mo>]</mo><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>[</mo><mi>L</mi><msup><mo>]</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup><mo>[</mo><mi>T</mi><msup><mo>]</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></math><br />Thus,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math><br />Thus,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>V</mi><msup><mo>]</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>[</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>T</mi><msup><mo>]</mo><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>[</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>F</mi><msup><mo>]</mo><mn>1</mn></msup></math></p>"
